    "engine": "knitr",
    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Picking that measures to the mark\"\ndescription: \"The widget carries each element's true vertices, not just its bounding box, so a cursor on a line picks that line, a click inside a region hits the region, and a graph edge is hoverable along its length.\"\ncategories: [Interactive]\nimage: figs/hit-testing.png\n---\n\n\n\nHover-picking in a web chart usually works on bounding boxes, because a box is all\nthe host knows. For points that is fine. For anything long and thin it is quietly\nwrong: a diagonal line's box covers most of the panel, so \"the nearest mark\" can be\na series whose ink is nowhere near the cursor.\n\nvellum knows the actual shape. `element_geometry()` reports each element's true\nvertices in device pixels, and `as_widget()` ships them, so picking is a two-step:\nan R-tree shortlists candidates by box (a box distance is never greater than the\ntrue distance, so nothing in range is missed), and the shortlist is then ranked by\ndistance to the *real* geometry.\n\nFour series whose boxes each cover most of the panel. Run the cursor along one\nline and the tooltip follows that line, not whichever box you happen to be inside:\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nvplot(series) |>\n  mark_line(x = t, y = value, color = series, linewidth = 1.2,\n            tooltip = series, data_id = id) |>\n  labs(title = \"Four overlapping boxes, four distinguishable lines\",\n       x = \"week\", y = \"index\") |>\n  as_widget(height = 420)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div id=\"htmlwidget-a8c50167a34f1d67d2f3\" style=\"width:576px;height:420px;\" class=\"vellumwidget html-widget\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-a8c50167a34f1d67d2f3\">{\"x\":{\"svg\":\"<?xml version=\\\"1.0\\\" encoding=\\\"UTF-8\\\"?>\\n<svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"576\\\" height=\\\"384\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 576 384\\\" role=\\\"img\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"vl117-t vl117-d\\\"><title id=\\\"vl117-t\\\">Four overlapping boxes, four distinguishable lines<\\/title><desc id=\\\"vl117-d\\\">A line chart. It plots index (vertical axis) against week (horizontal axis), where colour shows series. Based on 240 observations.<\\/desc><defs><clipPath id=\\\"c0\\\" clipPathUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\"><path d=\\\"M65.03936767578125 50.0367431640625 L484.3044595392983 50.0367431640625 L484.3044595392983 320.2939610118316 L65.03936767578125 320.2939610118316 Z\\\"/><\\/clipPath><\\/defs><rect width=\\\"576\\\" height=\\\"384\\\" fill=\\\"#ffffff\\\" fill-opacity=\\\"1\\\"/><g data-vellum-panel=\\\"plot\\\"><g data-vellum-panel=\\\"plot-background\\\"><g role=\\\"presentation\\\"><path d=\\\"M-0.5 -0.5 L0.5 -0.5 L0.5 0.5 L-0.5 0.5 Z\\\" fill=\\\"#ffffff\\\" fill-opacity=\\\"1\\\" transform=\\\"matrix(576 0 0 384 288 192)\\\"/><\\/g><\\/g><g data-vellum-panel=\\\"panel-area\\\"><g data-vellum-panel=\\\"panel-1-1\\\" clip-path=\\\"url(#c0)\\\"><g data-vellum-pan=\\\"panel-1-1\\\"><path d=\\\"M-0.5 -0.5 L0.5 -0.5 L0.5 0.5 L-0.5 0.5 Z\\\" fill=\\\"#ebebeb\\\" fill-opacity=\\\"1\\\" transform=\\\"matrix(419.2651 0 0 270.25723 274.67194 185.16536)\\\"/><g role=\\\"grid\\\"><path d=\\\"M44.89819 270.25723 L44.89819 0 M109.49989 270.25723 L109.49989 0 M174.10161 270.25723 L174.10161 0 M238.70331 270.25723 L238.70331 0 M303.30502 270.25723 L303.30502 0 M367.90674 270.25723 L367.90674 0 M432.50845 270.25723 L432.50845 0\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#ffffff\\\" stroke-opacity=\\\"1\\\" stroke-width=\\\"0.5\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-miterlimit=\\\"10\\\" transform=\\\"matrix(1 0 0 1 65.03937 50.036743)\\\"/><\\/g><g role=\\\"grid\\\"><path d=\\\"M0 243.07578 L419.2651 243.07578 M0 192.44296 L419.2651 192.44296 M0 141.81015 L419.2651 141.81015 M0 91.17733 L419.2651 91.17733 M0 40.54451 L419.2651 40.54451 M0 -10.088304 L419.2651 -10.088304\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#ffffff\\\" stroke-opacity=\\\"1\\\" stroke-width=\\\"0.5\\\